WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.937
Crumbling Canada: The $357 Billion Infrastructure Betrayal.

00:00:05.887 --> 00:00:14.887
The generation that stormed Juno Beach came home and built the Trans-Canada Highway, the St. Lawrence Seaway, and bridges that lasted eighty years.

00:00:14.887 --> 00:00:24.487
Their grandchildren inherited a country where water systems poison communities, bridges crack under load, and transit megaprojects hemorrhage billions.

00:00:24.487 --> 00:00:27.412
Every dollar cited below is sourced.
